ail address here in case you  would like to ask him questions directly  or have any follow-up or feedback  of the source for any questions he  answered today  but jim is there anything else that you  would like to go over any questions that  may have gotten delivered to you  that we had not discussed yet  no but i really appreciate all of our  participants  and especially the really good questions  that were  were asked  i think this  shows that there is a real interest in  tuvo  in general and in running  faster tph analyses  in specifically so  i do plan to look at some of the the  water methods for tph running on intubo  as soon as  our covet 19 restrictions are listed and  i can get back to the laboratory so we  should see some more  uh information about tph type analyses  on this platform  thank you jim  all right everyone so it appears we've  reached the conclusion of our event so  please join me in thanking jim mccurry  for his wonderful presentation  i will leave the session open for a few  minutes to receive any feedback or  additional questions  but we are now going to close the audio  line  thank you all once again for attending  and on behalf of azure technologies we  wish you all a great day
 

